// RUN: cd %corpus && ! %zomc compile --check 03-types/numeric_value_widening_rejected_neg.zom > %t 2>&1
// RUN: %FileCheck %s --input-file %t

// Only a numeric literal is polymorphic. A non-literal i32 value does not
// implicitly widen to i64 (no numeric widening without an explicit cast), so
// assigning an i32 parameter to an i64 local is ZOM4009.

// CHECK-LITERAL: Error [ZOM4009]: Type mismatch: expected i64, got i32
// CHECK-LITERAL:   --> conformance/03-types/numeric_value_widening_rejected_neg.zom:1:36
